<div class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col color-scheme-light wd-c1a3c761"><!-- wp:wd/title {"blockId":"be7b246c-006f-474f-802f-d727968c83f5","blockVersion":"2","content":"Why choose us?","displayWidth":"custom","customWidth":"375"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-wd-title title wd-be7b246c wd-custom-width">Why choose us?</h2>
<!-- /wp:wd/title -->

<!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"ae2b8e3d-147e-4c62-851e-d299bedc632c","blockVersion":"2","displayWidth":"custom","customWidth":"615"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-ae2b8e3d wd-custom-width">We’re EDC enthusiasts too. We only feature gear we’d proudly carry ourselves. With expert advice, we make your everyday easier, safer, and more efficient.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/cover --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/column --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/row -->

<!-- wp:wd/section {"blockId":"e137b5fc-bccd-4c0e-a162-bd57c2d662f5","blockVersion":"2","bgColorCode":"#ffffff","paddingTop":"60","paddingBottom":"60","marginBottom":"-40","paddingTopTablet":"40","paddingBottomTablet":"40"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-section wd-e137b5fc"><!-- wp:wd/container {"blockId":"216e48b2-651a-4f2b-a8b3-03b3624bdb79","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-container wd-dir-col wd-216e48b2"><!-- wp:wd/accordion {"blockId":"f985b6f2-84e7-44ea-9eaf-6a522a8e201a","blockVersion":"2","design":"shadow","allClosed":true,"openerIcon":"plus","openerSize":"16"} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion wd-accordion wd-style-shadow wd-titles-start wd-opener-style-plus wd-opener-pos-end wd-f985b6f2" data-state="all"><!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"657867ba-9731-4254-9879-0372e8988871","blockVersion":"2","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.15)","boxShadowBlur":0,"boxShadowSpread":1,"borderWidthLock":true} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-657867ba"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What is EDC?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"6d9a465a-e76f-438e-b93f-98145d781876","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-6d9a465a">EDC stands for "Everyday Carry". It refers to the essential tools and items you carry daily to be prepared for various situations.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"f5a702b6-8d58-4510-8fd0-aa2fdb16b787","blockVersion":"2","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.15)","boxShadowBlur":0,"boxShadowSpread":1,"borderWidthLock":true} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-f5a702b6"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>What are the most common EDC items?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"41d9d5ff-104c-4593-abcb-9935b0c29565","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-41d9d5ff">Popular EDC items include knives, multi-tools, flashlights, wallets, pens, and key organizers.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"2662df18-7a00-4b4e-9c13-c86e28a77737","blockVersion":"2","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.15)","boxShadowBlur":0,"boxShadowSpread":1,"borderWidthLock":true} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-2662df18"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How do i choose the right EDC gear?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"e9b320dc-1444-459e-97d2-34c6b30ed565","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-e9b320dc">Consider your daily needs, environment, and budget. Start with basics like a quality knife or flashlight, and build your kit over time. </p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"831083bd-5d15-4456-83ea-ad75471793e6","blockVersion":"2","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.15)","boxShadowBlur":0,"boxShadowSpread":1,"borderWidthLock":true} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-831083bd"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>Are EDC items legal to carry?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"d905de40-bd4a-47eb-9053-26a5ff4ae62b","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-d905de40">It depends on your location and the type of gear (e.g., knives or self-defense tools). Always check local laws and regulations.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane -->

<!-- wp:wd/accordion-pane {"blockId":"f61647d6-9c7f-43f5-8ea5-b642672e4a2a","blockVersion":"2","boxShadowColorCode":"rgba(0,0,0,0.15)","boxShadowBlur":0,"boxShadowSpread":1,"borderWidthLock":true} -->
<div class="wp-block-wd-accordion-pane wd-accordion-item wd-f61647d6"><div class="wd-accordion-title wd-role-btn" tabindex="0"><div class="wd-accordion-title-text"><span>How do i maintain my EDC gear?</span></div><span class="wd-accordion-opener"></span></div><div class="wd-accordion-content"><div class="wd-accordion-content-inner"><!-- wp:wd/paragraph {"blockId":"1e5004fa-4e24-4e0f-ab90-406b615d901f","blockVersion":"2"} -->
<p class="wp-block-wd-paragraph wd-1e5004fa">Regularly clean and oil tools, replace batteries in electronics, and store items in a safe, dry place when not in use.</p>
<!-- /wp:wd/paragraph --></div></div></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion-pane --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/accordion --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/container --></div>
<!-- /wp:wd/section -->]]></content:encoded>
